  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>After a death, Chayce can help with the practical side: sorting belongings with the family, packing and moving what is being kept, and moving a surviving partner or relative into a new home. We are not a probate service, legal advisers or a house clearance firm, so we do not give legal advice or empty a property for disposal. Packages start at &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}.</p></div>
  </div>
